mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Need an external HTTP or SOAP call?] --> Q1{Secrets or URL in Apex?}
  Q1 -->|Yes today| NC[Move to named credential; use callout:Name]
  Q1 -->|Already NC| Q2{DML already done in this transaction?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Qable[Queueable after commit with AllowsCallouts]
  Q2 -->|No, callout first is safe| Sync[Callout then DML if design allows]
  Need --> Q3{Test?}
  Q3 -->|Always| Mock[HttpCalloutMock; never depend on the live allocator]
  Need --> Q4{Transient 429 or timeout?}
  Q4 -->|Retry| Delay[Queueable delay 1-10 min; idempotent POST or GET status]
  Q4 -->|Poison message| Halt[Stop chaining; log LAB_ error]
